    "title": "NORWAY'S DOOMSDAY VAULT: PROTECTING THE WORLD'S FOOD",
    "seoTitle": "Svalbard Global Seed Vault and the crops it protects",
    "metaDescription": "How Norway’s Svalbard Seed Vault stores duplicate seeds, who can retrieve them and how ICARDA used its backup to restore collections.",
    "excerpt": "How Norway’s Svalbard Seed Vault stores duplicate seeds, who can retrieve them and how ICARDA used its backup to restore collections.",
    "category": "Science",
    "schemaType": "Article",
    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-11-17",
    "author": "PRESDA Editorial",
